{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"messenger","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/StandardMessenger","text":"StandardMessenger","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GnustoEngine17StandardMessengerC","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This provider supplies all user-facing messages throughout the game, including","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"action responses, parse errors, and system messages. Games can provide custom","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"implementations to:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Support multiple languages (internationalization)"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Customize the tone and style of responses"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Override specific messages while inheriting sensible defaults","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If not specified, the engine will use the built-in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MessageProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" with traditional"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"English interactive fiction responses."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Testing Note"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Custom "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MessageProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" subclasses should accept a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RandomNumberGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter in their initializer to support deterministic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"testing via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"withSeededRNG()"},{"type":"text","text":". The default implementation automatically uses"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the blueprint’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"randomNumberGenerator"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Example:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var messenger: StandardMessenger {","    \/\/ Custom messenger for a horror-themed game","    HorrorMessenger(randomNumberGenerator: randomNumberGenerator)","}"]}]}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustoengine\/gameblueprint\/messenger"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"defaultImplementationsSections":[{"anchor":"GameBlueprint-Implementations","title":"GameBlueprint Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/GameBlueprint\/messenger-8hmup"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine","doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/GameBlueprint"]]},"metadata":{"required":true,"roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"GnustoEngine"}],"externalID":"s:12GnustoEngine13GameBlueprintP9messengerAA17StandardMessengerCvp","symbolKind":"property","title":"messenger","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"messenger"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12GnustoEngine17StandardMessengerC","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"StandardMessenger"}]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/GnustoEngine\/documentation\/GnustoEngine\/GameBlueprint\/messenger","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The message provider for game text localization and customizati